---
import Photo from "./Photo.astro";
---

<section
  class="community-story"
  id="our-story"
  aria-labelledby="community-story-heading"
>
  <div class="wrap story-inner">
    <header class="story-heading">
      <span class="story-label">Our story</span>
      <h2 id="community-story-heading">How GHL Bangladesh began.</h2>
      <p class="story-byline">A note from Mehedi Sharif</p>
      <p class="story-credit">
        Co-organised by Mehedi Sharif and <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/vidmshariful"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Shariful Islam on Facebook (opens in a new tab)"
          >Shariful Islam</a
        >
      </p>
      <div class="story-people" role="group" aria-label="Meetup co-organisers">
        <figure class="story-person">
          <Photo
            name="dsc08672"
            alt="Mehedi Sharif holding a microphone beside the GHL Bangladesh meetup banner"
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 45vw, 225px"
          />
          <figcaption>Mehedi Sharif</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="story-person">
          <Photo
            name="dsc08253"
            alt="Shariful Islam at the GHL Bangladesh meetup"
            width={1800}
            height={2699}
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 45vw, 225px"
          />
          <figcaption>Shariful Islam</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <p>
        Proud to share a glimpse of GHL Bangladesh MeetUp 2026, an unofficial,
        community-driven meetup that I had the honour of organizing along with
        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/vidmshariful"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Shariful Islam on Facebook (opens in a new tab)"
          ><strong>Shariful Islam</strong></a
        > back on <time datetime="2026-06-11">June 11</time>.
      </p>
      <p>
        It all started when Shariful and I kept talking about how many people in
        Bangladesh work with GoHighLevel every day, yet we hardly ever meet in
        person. So we decided to change that. Nothing fancy, just people who use
        GHL sitting in one room, sharing what’s actually working for them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I didn’t expect the room to fill up the way it did. The speakers were
        open about their real experiences, people asked great questions, and the
        conversations felt genuine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community-story {
    background: #f6f8f1;
    color: #193f33;
    font-family: "Chapter Reference", "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  .story-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(44px, 7vw, 100px);
    padding-block: 76px 88px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d6ddcf;
  }
  .story-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #64745f;
    font:
      600 10px/1.5 "DM Sans",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .story-heading h2 {
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #193f33;
    font-family: "Chapter Reference", "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 3.4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.14;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .story-byline {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #687568;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .story-credit {
    max-width: 305px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: #315344;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .story-credit a,
  .story-copy a {
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }
  .story-credit a:hover,
  .story-copy a:hover {
    color: #52714b;
  }
  .story-credit a:focus-visible,
  .story-copy a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #315344;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .story-people {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .story-person {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .story-person :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .story-person figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #315344;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .story-copy {
    max-width: 660px;
  }
  .story-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #536b5b;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .story-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 23px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .story-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
      padding-block: 48px 56px;
    }
    .story-label {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .story-heading h2 {
      max-width: 340px;
      font-size: clamp(33px, 8vw, 40px);
    }
    .story-byline {
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .story-credit {
      max-width: 340px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .story-people {
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }
    .story-person figcaption {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .story-copy {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
    .story-copy p {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .story-copy p + p {
      margin-top: 21px;
    }
  }
</style>
